WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.960
Lots of times we can feel triggered and want to stay away or get angry, but other times

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:08.080
we might feel numb.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:11.320
Numb means you don't feel any emotions about something.

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:16.240
It happens when you have seen, felt, or heard something bad so many times that you don't

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:19.679
react anymore.

00:00:19.679 --> 00:00:22.760
This numb feeling can happen with good things too.

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:26.839
It's when someone doesn't look forward to or enjoy happy events anymore.

00:00:26.839 --> 00:00:29.879
They just feel bleh.

00:00:29.879 --> 00:00:34.839
Sometimes at a happy event like a birthday party they might even feel angry or sad.

00:00:34.839 --> 00:00:38.679
So kids can be triggered by good or bad things.

00:00:38.679 --> 00:00:43.479
Sometimes they feel numb and other times they get really upset.

00:00:43.479 --> 00:00:45.439
We all have triggers.

00:00:45.439 --> 00:00:47.719
These are things that affect us a lot.

00:00:47.719 --> 00:00:49.799
They can change how we think.

00:00:49.799 --> 00:00:54.759
For example, because his gym teacher is mean, Mike might start thinking people can't be

00:00:54.759 --> 00:01:00.479
trusted, or he might think the world is scary, or that there is something wrong with him,

00:01:00.479 --> 00:01:02.280
even when there isn't.

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:05.280
These thoughts can change how we feel.

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:11.439
Someone who is often triggered might feel afraid, angry, sad, bored, or upset most of

00:01:11.439 --> 00:01:12.000
the day.

